cmu-cmd-attachment-offsets-desc = Opens a tool for lining up a weapon's attachment overlays and copying the offsets as YAML.
cmu-cmd-attachment-offsets-help = Usage: attachmentoffsets [entity id]. With no id, uses the item in your active hand. Only changes what your own client draws.
cmu-cmd-attachment-offsets-bad-entity = No entity with id {$entity}.
cmu-cmd-attachment-offsets-nothing-held = Hold a weapon in your active hand, or give an entity id.
cmu-cmd-attachment-offsets-no-visuals = That has no AttachableHolderVisuals component, so it can't draw attachments. Add one to its prototype first.
